      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "intended audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for an audience familiar with Islamophobic and misogynistic stereotypes, particularly those who may hold or propagate harmful views about Muslim women being oppressed or vulnerable to violence. The target audience likely includes individuals who are either unaware of the harmful nature of the meme or who actively engage with content that reinforces these stereotypes. The meme's use of visual metaphors (cat as Muslim man, butterfly as Muslim woman) and the punchline 'is this a punching bag?' are culturally coded to resonate with those who understand or are predisposed to accept Islamophobic tropes and misogynistic objectification. The audience may also include those who are critical of Muslim communities and seek to portray them as inherently violent or incompatible with Western values, as implied by the background knowledge entities.",
